{"title":"2003 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2003 AMC 12A Problems\">2003 AMC 12A #2</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2003 AMC 10A Problems\">2003 AMC 10A #2</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution(no_sound)_~OddPeppyBoots)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution(no sound) ~OddPeppyBoots)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Members of the Rockham Soccer League buy socks and T-shirts. Socks cost &#36;4 per pair and each T-shirt costs &#36;5 more than a pair of socks. Each member needs one pair of socks and a shirt for home games and another pair of socks and a shirt for away games. If the total cost is &#36;2366, how many members are in the League? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/1/ee1adb85f7bf684dd2dd8153d68632cda913fdc2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 77\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 91\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 143\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 182\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 286$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"414\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since T-shirts cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> dollars more than a pair of socks, T-shirts cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/9/36954831b41765ebc39d172a6a62fab2c7491f25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5+4=9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" /> dollars. \n</p><p>Since each member needs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> pairs of socks and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> T-shirts, the total cost for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> member is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/4/b5432f3c36c756d18d0f22277a4774b5cc280d11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(4+9)=26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" /> dollars. \n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/a/eaa10942897cc7b21942a628d6ccf624b629ad80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2366$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> dollars was the cost for the club, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/a/bda00d9a38a0c6bd9aac2512c6d065581882d43c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> was the cost per member, the number of members in the League is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/0/370796b86dccbd05ff805f9753ea8fbaa5e0f7c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2366\\div 26=\\boxed{\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 91}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"163\" height=\"29\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution.28no_sound.29_.7EOddPeppyBoots.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution(no_sound)_~OddPeppyBoots)\">Video Solution(no sound) ~OddPeppyBoots)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution(no sound) ~OddPeppyBoots)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1tU_HmCUMWZ-DMsGcz_7wLy8tniXDh0q0/view?usp=drivesdk\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1tU_HmCUMWZ-DMsGcz_7wLy8tniXDh0q0/view?usp=drivesdk</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%